  ('3105.90.10', '3105.90', 'Mineral or chemical fertilisers containing two fertilising elements namely nitrogen and potassium', NULL, 'Free', 'Export of Micronutirent fertilizers and mixtures thereof containing NPK, excluding those specified in Schedule I , Part A 1 (f) of Fertilizers (Control) Order, 1985 is Free wherein export is permitted subject to:- 1. prior permission /no objection certificate (NOC) of the Department of fertilizers (DOF). 2. production of Declaration /certificate as at (1) before customs at the time of export.'),
